            "_collect_relationships",
            "ArchitectureModel",
            "_inject_sub_behaviors",
            "warning",
            "add",
            "len",
            "ModelMeta",
            "Entities"
          ],
          "docstring": "Generate sub-models for each F-block by tracing parent model relationships.\n\nFor each F-block:\n1. Find components by file path matching\n2. Trace realizes/exposes/traces-to/constrained-by to find connected entities\n3. Collect internal + boundary relationships\n4. Build sub-model with parent's actual entities (not invented ones)\n\nArgs:\n    project_root: Root directory with .architecture-model.yaml\n    model_path: Optional path to model file (default: project_root/.architecture-model.yaml)\n\nReturns:\n    Dict mapping block_id -> ArchitectureModel (sub-model)"
        },
        {
          "name": "compact_root_model",
